    "title": "con_28551 - Technical Advisory Services 2025 (6 of 8)",
    "description": "The Department for Education (DfE) has established a panel arrangement for the provision of Technical Advisory Services in support of the construction and delivery of school building projects across England. \r\n\r\nUnder this arrangement, eight (8) Technical Advisors have been appointed to provide multi-disciplinary technical expertise to support DfE project teams throughout the full lifecycle of construction projects. \r\n\r\nThis Notice confirms the award of one (1) of the eight (8) contracts issued under this panel arrangement.",
